Feature: Login # features/login.feature:1
  The demo app's sign-in flow, covered only with bundled steps.
  Scenario: Successful login                   # features/login.feature:4
    Given I navigate to "index.html"           # ../../behave_playwright/steps/navigation.py:15
    When I fill "Email" with "ada@example.com" # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I fill "Password" with "secret"        # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I click "Sign in"                      # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    Then I should see "Welcome back"           # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18

  Scenario: Login requires email and password      # features/login.feature:11
    Given I navigate to "index.html"               # ../../behave_playwright/steps/navigation.py:15
    When I click "Sign in"                         # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    Then I should see "Invalid credentials"        # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    And the "css=#error" element should be visible # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:30

Feature: Network mocking # features/network.feature:1
  Playwright-exclusive steps: intercept and request assertions.
  Scenario: Todos served from a mocked API         # features/network.feature:4
    Given I intercept "**/api/todos" and return:   # ../../behave_playwright/steps/network.py:27
      """
      ["Mocked todo", "Intercepted by page.route"]
      """
    When I navigate to "index.html"                # ../../behave_playwright/steps/navigation.py:15
    And I fill "Email" with "ada@example.com"      # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I fill "Password" with "secret"            # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I click "Sign in"                          # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    Then I should see "Mocked todo"                # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    And I should see "Intercepted by page.route"   # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    And I should not see "Write tests"             # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:24
    And a "GET" request was made to "**/api/todos" # ../../behave_playwright/steps/network.py:47

Feature: Todo list # features/todos.feature:1
  The demo app falls back to built-in todos when no API is reachable.
  Feature: Todo list  # features/todos.feature:1

  Scenario: Default todos are shown            # features/todos.feature:10
    Given I navigate to "index.html"           # ../../behave_playwright/steps/navigation.py:15
    When I fill "Email" with "ada@example.com" # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I fill "Password" with "secret"        # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I click "Sign in"                      # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    Then I should see "Write tests"            # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    And I should see "2 items left"            # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18

  Scenario: Add and complete a todo                  # features/todos.feature:14
    Given I navigate to "index.html"                 # ../../behave_playwright/steps/navigation.py:15
    When I fill "Email" with "ada@example.com"       # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I fill "Password" with "secret"              # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I click "Sign in"                            # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    When I fill "New todo" with "Read the changelog" # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:41
    And I click "Add"                                # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:16
    Then I should see "Read the changelog"           # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    And I should see "3 items left"                  # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18
    When I check "Read the changelog"                # ../../behave_playwright/steps/interaction.py:60
    Then I should see "2 items left"                 # ../../behave_playwright/steps/assertions.py:18

